WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.362 --> 00:00:03.925
在第三级目录新建请求 / Create a request in the third-level folder

2
00:00:03.925 --> 00:00:07.485
命名Guide persisted fields / Name it Guide persisted fields

3
00:00:07.485 --> 00:00:10.503
填写带Query的自有地址 / Enter the owned URL with its Query

4
00:00:10.503 --> 00:00:13.595
选择POST / Select POST

5
00:00:13.595 --> 00:00:16.635
固定HTTP/1.1 / Select HTTP/1.1 explicitly

6
00:00:16.635 --> 00:00:19.741
添加Header x-guide-persist / Add Header x-guide-persist

7
00:00:19.741 --> 00:00:22.849
添加Header x-guide-disabled / Add Header x-guide-disabled

8
00:00:22.849 --> 00:00:25.898
停用但保留第二个Header / Disable but retain the second Header

9
00:00:25.898 --> 00:00:29.111
添加scope=retained / Add scope=retained

10
00:00:29.111 --> 00:00:32.658
保存本次JSON正文 / Save this JSON body

11
00:00:32.658 --> 00:00:35.841
保存公开演示Bearer字段 / Save the public demonstration Bearer field

12
00:00:35.841 --> 00:00:38.778
确认真正保存且尚未Send / Confirm saved state without sending
